  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced Integrated Framework 2016 - 2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EIF&#x2019;s purpose is, through a unique global partnership, to support LDCs to use trade as a tool for economic growth and poverty reduction. EIF empowers LDCs to identify where trade can form an integral part of national development strategies and assists them to leverage AfT.</narrative>
  </description>
